----- SOURCE CODE
-- one.i
pub opaque type Two { Two }

-- main.i
import one

pub fn main() {
  one.Two
}

----- ERROR
error: Use of private value
  ┌─ /src/one/two.i:4:7
  │
4 │   one.Two
  │       ^^^

`one` does define `Two`, but it is private and cannot be accessed by other
modules.
